WEBVTT

00:11.450 --> 00:14.840
You know, I can't decide unless I see them moving.

00:15.260 --> 00:21.070
I'm afraid we can't let you 'test drive' them like a car, because you might damage them.

00:21.530 --> 00:23.170
Test drive, eh...

00:23.680 --> 00:26.440
Well, we have a wide range of robots.

00:26.840 --> 00:27.940
The Mother type.

00:27.940 --> 00:28.990
The Older-sister type.

00:28.990 --> 00:30.410
The Younger-sister type.

00:30.410 --> 00:31.630
The Childhood-friend type.

00:31.630 --> 00:32.540
The New-type type.

00:32.540 --> 00:33.000
Tsundere.

00:33.000 --> 00:33.310
Kuudere.

00:33.310 --> 00:33.830
Yandere.

00:33.830 --> 00:35.190
Etcetera, etcetera.

00:35.200 --> 00:37.080
We have a great variety of robots!

00:48.460 --> 00:50.060
My master...

00:53.620 --> 00:54.910
What's wrong?

00:54.930 --> 00:57.350
Oh, nothing.

01:01.860 --> 01:03.450
I've decided to take this girl.

01:03.730 --> 01:08.590
Well, but that is a Maid type robot.

01:10.810 --> 01:14.900
If you're after a romantic relationship type, you might prefer a different one.

01:15.070 --> 01:18.020
No. I need no one else but her.

01:18.020 --> 01:19.760
I want no one else but her.

01:21.610 --> 01:22.850
Is that so?

01:23.380 --> 01:26.140
Then, we'll set her up and send her to you.

01:26.420 --> 01:28.960
We hope you'll be a nice master.

01:29.700 --> 01:31.030
Yeah, of course.

02:58.740 --> 03:01.510
Don't look at me as if I were a pig!

03:01.760 --> 03:03.870
Sign:  Don't Look At Me As If I Were a Pig.

03:11.500 --> 03:13.400
Thank you
for shopping with us.

03:16.250 --> 03:18.440
How indecent...

03:25.870 --> 03:30.120
Nice to meet you, my master.

03:30.710 --> 03:33.580
You are small... and cute.

03:34.740 --> 03:36.390
Wrong!!

03:36.650 --> 03:37.750
I'm sorry.

03:37.760 --> 03:40.220
My eyes seem to need some focusing.

03:40.440 --> 03:41.630
Now I can...

03:43.350 --> 03:44.810
What's this?!

03:44.810 --> 03:47.240
Why am I dressed in this embarrassing outfit?!

03:47.680 --> 03:50.210
That would be part of the good service from the store manager.

03:53.360 --> 03:56.680
Don't look at me as if I were a pig that's about to be sold.

03:57.180 --> 03:58.090
Pig?!

03:58.120 --> 03:59.840
You have a rather foul-mouth.

04:00.040 --> 04:01.580
Oh, I'm sorry.

04:01.780 --> 04:05.470
This is... uh, how I'm programmed.

04:05.640 --> 04:06.760
That must be a lie!

04:07.670 --> 04:09.730
Now I'm gonna untie you, so don't cry.

04:09.730 --> 04:11.230
What are you doing!

04:11.240 --> 04:13.430
I'm naked if you take it off!

04:13.450 --> 04:15.330
You did that on purpose, right?

04:15.360 --> 04:17.170
You must have done it on purpose!

04:17.440 --> 04:19.880
Although I am a Maid Robot,

04:19.910 --> 04:21.950
why are you sexually harassing me before I actually start working!?

04:21.950 --> 04:23.170
You're too much!

04:23.170 --> 04:26.330
Calm down, I have clothes for you. Here!

04:27.540 --> 04:31.240
Such a frilly apron dress is too shameful to wear!

04:31.450 --> 04:33.330
I am a maid, you know.

04:33.330 --> 04:34.710
All I need is an apron.

04:34.710 --> 04:35.810
Give me one.

04:36.370 --> 04:39.790
All I need is an apron.

04:41.040 --> 04:43.450
I would rather enjoy it after we get more intimate with each other.

04:43.910 --> 04:47.780
What are you saying?
Are you planning to let me wear nothing?

04:48.950 --> 04:50.960
Could it be that...

04:50.960 --> 04:54.040
...I ended up with the wrong master?

04:54.580 --> 04:57.450
I won't treat you badly.
Hey, let me help you put this on.

04:58.010 --> 05:00.120
I can put it on by myself!

05:00.160 --> 05:01.350
Don't be selfish!

05:02.100 --> 05:03.510
You're saying this is selfish?

05:03.510 --> 05:06.490
Here, hey. C'mon...

05:08.710 --> 05:11.060
I'm not your dress-up doll!

05:23.440 --> 05:25.670
Have you woken up, my master?

05:31.910 --> 05:34.050
I'm sorry about earlier.

05:35.530 --> 05:38.160
My master, are you all right?

05:41.280 --> 05:43.030
Oh, I'm okay.

05:43.290 --> 05:45.680
I was just stunned by your cuteness.

05:45.980 --> 05:48.210
Don't say such silly things.

05:48.210 --> 05:51.150
That's not something needed for a maid's work.

05:51.900 --> 05:53.850
That's how I'm programmed.

05:55.360 --> 05:56.550
Don't be silly.

05:56.800 --> 05:59.200
Okay, by the way...

05:59.210 --> 06:01.660
I feel there's something strange about this room.

06:04.610 --> 06:08.280
Those dolls have gone somewhere by themselves.

06:10.440 --> 06:14.210
It's scary, isn't it? I'm sure they were cursed dolls.

06:14.570 --> 06:17.220
That can't be true!
Where did you put them?

06:17.220 --> 06:22.460
I just disposed of all the useless stuff to create a pleasant work environment.

06:22.470 --> 06:24.170
Disposed of?

06:24.440 --> 06:27.330
That's why you look so happy, huh?

06:27.870 --> 06:30.170
That's what Maid Robots usually do.

06:30.170 --> 06:33.400
They were unnecessary for your wholesome life.

06:34.010 --> 06:35.100
Hey you!

06:35.410 --> 06:39.260
How could you throw away the dolls?
They might have possessed souls of their own.

06:40.810 --> 06:41.930
You'll be cursed.

06:41.950 --> 06:44.640
What are you planning on doing?

06:44.640 --> 06:45.910
Stop it!

06:45.970 --> 06:48.800
Oh, no! Unbelievable!

06:48.800 --> 06:51.190
That's not what maids are supposed to do!

06:51.190 --> 06:53.550
She threw us away.

06:53.550 --> 06:55.230
She threw us all away!

06:55.810 --> 06:57.210
We won't forgive her.

06:57.280 --> 06:59.760
Oh, no! What should I do?

07:00.110 --> 07:02.240
In such a situation, you'll need this costume.

07:02.250 --> 07:04.180
This will purify curses.

07:04.250 --> 07:05.550
So let me help you put this on!

07:05.580 --> 07:09.320
No! Don't treat me as if I'm a dress-up doll!

07:09.590 --> 07:11.630
Eh, but still...

07:12.740 --> 07:16.470
This is the reason why I bought you.

07:16.650 --> 07:20.240
I mean, I want to serve you as a maid instead!

07:21.550 --> 07:28.330
I thought I was born into this world to serve somebody as a maid.

07:29.740 --> 07:31.990
But, that's... too much!

07:33.360 --> 07:34.410
Wait!

07:36.270 --> 07:40.870
When you go outside, you have to put on these outdoor clothes, not that indoor set!

07:42.460 --> 07:43.170
Idiot!

07:43.380 --> 07:47.130
My master is a doll maniac! A dress-up doll pervert!

07:44.810 --> 07:47.130
She's fast! Too fast!

07:52.310 --> 07:54.970
The situation made me run away from his room...

07:56.780 --> 07:59.680
If a Maid Robot runs away from their master,

07:59.700 --> 08:03.550
we're obligated to pay enormous compensation fees, and dispose of the robot.

08:04.270 --> 08:07.240
I can't! I can't go back to the store!

08:08.020 --> 08:10.900
But he treats me like a doll.

08:11.210 --> 08:13.940
And what's worse, he has a fetish for dress-up dolls.

08:13.940 --> 08:17.460
Who wants to go back to a master with such a girlish hobby?

08:17.920 --> 08:19.740
No girl has such a hobby.

08:19.740 --> 08:21.640
That's what men are supposed to enjoy.

08:22.790 --> 08:23.970
My master.

08:24.390 --> 08:25.970
Sorry about earlier.

08:26.210 --> 08:28.150
I went too far too suddenly.

08:28.590 --> 08:31.190
If you don't want me to treat you like a doll, I'll compromise.

08:31.830 --> 08:34.930
So, is there any chance you could come back?

08:34.930 --> 08:38.710
But I've thrown your favorite...

08:38.940 --> 08:42.070
Even so, I only want you!

08:46.240 --> 08:48.010
<i>I need no one else but her.</i>

08:51.060 --> 08:53.190
So, you were the one back then...

08:55.130 --> 09:00.050
Me too. I'd like to serve you.

09:00.920 --> 09:01.970
Good to hear...

09:02.430 --> 09:03.580
Thank you, Yui.

09:04.080 --> 09:04.960
Yes!

09:06.770 --> 09:07.840
Yui?

09:08.200 --> 09:09.750
That's your name.

09:09.750 --> 09:12.400
I thought of it long before I met you.

09:12.400 --> 09:14.260
It's a name only for you.

09:16.880 --> 09:22.100
Yui... A name only for me, given by my master.

09:22.100 --> 09:23.550
Only for me...

09:25.290 --> 09:29.060
Also, can you stop calling me 'my master'?

09:29.060 --> 09:30.470
I'm Murase Takaya.

09:30.730 --> 09:32.760
Murase...Takaya.

09:32.960 --> 09:34.970
Yes! Murase-san!

09:34.970 --> 09:36.010
Much better.

09:36.010 --> 09:36.920
Murase-san.

09:39.610 --> 09:43.050
I'm sorry for throwing away all your dolls.

09:43.870 --> 09:46.310
What's past is past. Don't worry about it.

09:46.880 --> 09:48.660
<i>What a big-hearted person...</i>

09:48.980 --> 09:51.350
<i>I shouldn't have done such a thing to him.</i>

09:55.860 --> 10:00.600
It's quite common to keep dolls not only for display but also in reserve.

10:00.600 --> 10:03.190
So let me change your clothes to the indoor set!

10:03.580 --> 10:06.740
What?! Didn't you just say you'd compromise?!

10:06.740 --> 10:09.900
Yeah, I'm compromising by only changing your costume five times a day.

10:09.900 --> 10:12.330
That's not a compromise!

10:14.880 --> 10:17.230
Nooooo!!

10:18.780 --> 10:20.440
Phew, I'm satisfied.

10:21.420 --> 10:25.420
I must endure this, because he gave me a name...

10:27.660 --> 10:28.970
Don't tell me...

10:30.020 --> 10:35.050
You're treating me just like another doll, after all!

10:35.150 --> 10:36.270
Far from it!

10:36.270 --> 10:38.130
Every doll has a different name.

10:39.340 --> 10:40.750
Fine, okay...

10:40.770 --> 10:42.650
Then this is what you get!

10:44.670 --> 10:46.370
If you want to treat me like a doll,

10:46.380 --> 10:49.050
then mod and customize me to your heart's content.

10:49.680 --> 10:52.690
C'mon, that's not fun!

10:54.520 --> 10:58.990
<i>So, Murase-san really turned out to be a good-for-nothing master.</i>

10:59.920 --> 11:02.030
Hey, what's your name?

11:08.980 --> 11:11.120
Please don't make me do anymore.

11:14.890 --> 11:17.840
I'm happy to be going out together with Murase-san!

11:18.490 --> 11:21.520
It'd be nice if we could have more
opportunities like this from now on.

11:23.250 --> 11:25.860
I'm also happy to hear that.

11:28.070 --> 11:30.450
<i>Just as I planned!</i>

11:31.250 --> 11:33.260
Come, Yui. It's time to change your costume.

11:33.550 --> 11:36.760
Why do you have so many different kinds of maid costumes?

11:36.760 --> 11:39.670
Because girls should wear different clothes everyday.

11:39.670 --> 11:43.250
I'd appreciate it if you showed your kindness in other ways.

11:43.420 --> 11:46.110
Girls should keep their bodies clean.

11:46.110 --> 11:48.380
I can wash my body by myself!

11:48.550 --> 11:51.710
To begin with, my whole body is antibacterial!

11:52.430 --> 11:54.430
Why do I have to share the bed with him?

11:55.660 --> 11:58.190
But he's happily sleeping.

11:58.810 --> 12:00.700
You're gonna wear that costume tomorrow....

12:03.150 --> 12:05.820
He's thinking of the same thing even while sleeping?

12:06.220 --> 12:10.570
<i>Once we get out of his room, there is no way he can treat me as a dress-up doll.</i>

12:10.580 --> 12:13.500
<i>It's pretty easy to control him.</i>

12:15.660 --> 12:17.750
<i>That would be what she's thinking right now.<u></u></i>

12:17.750 --> 12:20.410
<i>She's wearing the outdoor dress I chose anyway.</i>

12:20.410 --> 12:23.620
<i>She's a bit silly, but that's why she's cute.</i>

12:25.890 --> 12:29.330
You're alone here, so you're lost, aren't you?

12:29.710 --> 12:31.120
Where are your Dad and Mom?

12:34.620 --> 12:36.020
What should I do?

12:36.170 --> 12:37.710
Oh, yeah!

12:37.970 --> 12:39.850
Look! I'm a rabbit, you see?

12:40.410 --> 12:41.920
Let's be friends!

12:47.480 --> 12:50.130
Murase-san! We've got to report her to the police!

12:51.050 --> 12:52.780
Huh? Are you talking about that lost child?

12:52.790 --> 12:56.230
No! She's dancing like that in public!

12:56.230 --> 12:57.740
It's criminal!

13:01.320 --> 13:03.290
The rabbit is really cute.

13:05.370 --> 13:07.700
Ah, that one...

13:08.520 --> 13:11.430
Heaven, boobs, and people call us!

13:11.430 --> 13:13.710
Heaven, boobs, and people know us!

13:14.070 --> 13:17.260
To those who tempt people with their outrageous boobs,

13:17.260 --> 13:19.310
we, Midou Sumire and...

13:19.310 --> 13:23.720
...Midou Ran, in the name of 'A-cup Idol Miko Sisters'...

13:24.320 --> 13:25.850
...shall give punishment!

13:28.320 --> 13:31.890
You didn't have to say something
unnecessary like A-cup, Ran-chan.

13:31.890 --> 13:34.480
I'm sorry, Nee-sama.

13:34.480 --> 13:36.550
It's all the boob girl's fault.

13:37.210 --> 13:40.570
I command thee to come forth, Takochu-kun of another world!

13:46.830 --> 13:50.100
Oh no! These slimy tentacles are wrapping around me.

13:50.560 --> 13:52.190
You like rabbits, don't you?

13:52.190 --> 13:55.240
Nope. He is the only one I like.

13:55.760 --> 13:57.170
I see.

13:57.170 --> 13:58.580
He's cute, isn't he?

13:58.580 --> 13:59.260
Yeah.

13:59.830 --> 14:01.680
But, you're cute too.

14:02.280 --> 14:04.600
So don't give me a surly look.

14:04.600 --> 14:06.610
You're feeling lonely 'cause you're lost?

14:06.850 --> 14:08.630
No! Just Mom is lost...

14:11.620 --> 14:15.820
Alright, let's go eat something before looking for your lost Mom.

14:16.300 --> 14:18.130
What's your name?

14:18.570 --> 14:19.940
I'm Murase Takaya.

14:20.780 --> 14:22.640
I'm Hagiwara Ayumi.

14:22.640 --> 14:24.200
Nice to meet you, Takaya!

14:24.220 --> 14:25.210
Yup.

14:25.860 --> 14:29.510
Murase-san does look like... a good man.

14:30.350 --> 14:32.680
Not that again... Don't speak ill of me.

14:40.680 --> 14:42.160
Why did you look away from me!?

14:42.740 --> 14:43.890
Excuse me...

14:45.050 --> 14:47.680
How about our café then?

14:47.710 --> 14:48.630
Eh?

14:49.020 --> 14:51.400
I'm Sumitomo Minori.

14:52.620 --> 14:54.220
I'm back, Dad.

14:55.180 --> 14:56.460
Welcome home.

14:56.460 --> 14:58.640
Oh, you have company?

14:58.640 --> 15:00.690
This is our café.

15:05.170 --> 15:07.810
So that is your uniform, isn't it?

15:07.810 --> 15:10.860
It looks kinda weird, are you really okay with it?

15:10.860 --> 15:12.740
Eh, what's wrong with this?

15:13.040 --> 15:15.050
You've still got a ways to go yet, Yui.

15:15.050 --> 15:16.750
What do you mean by that?

15:16.750 --> 15:21.660
I could tell just by looking at Sumitomo-san that she's a perfect example of a man's dreams.

15:22.670 --> 15:24.440
There wouldn't be another man like you...

15:24.440 --> 15:25.950
You're totally right!

15:25.950 --> 15:30.000
I've been dreaming of running a café that has this kind of costume since I was little.

15:30.000 --> 15:31.270
Are you serious?

15:31.270 --> 15:34.560
Don't force your daughter to wear such a costume, please!

15:34.560 --> 15:37.760
I'm proud of my daughter. Nice, isn't she?

15:37.760 --> 15:41.430
Yeah. The costume can make your daughter look cute,

15:41.430 --> 15:46.020
while satisfying your requirements for costumes. I find it admirable.

15:46.020 --> 15:49.860
And speaking of your style, you don't spoil her appealing features...

15:49.860 --> 15:55.150
...while tailoring her clothes to your preferences. If anything, it brings out the best in her.

15:56.190 --> 15:57.640
I'm Murase Takaya.

15:58.070 --> 15:59.760
I'm Sumitomo Tetsushi.

16:02.290 --> 16:04.490
No way! Another pervert?!

16:04.560 --> 16:07.820
Are you really okay with being treated like a toy?

16:07.820 --> 16:11.340
Eh, but I find this costume cute, so I don't mind.

16:11.340 --> 16:15.040
Also, this is what men usually like, right?

16:15.040 --> 16:16.310
You've been tailored to his fetish!

16:16.310 --> 16:18.690
And your idea is totally different from normal girls!

16:18.740 --> 16:21.750
Takaya, you can tailor me as well.

16:21.970 --> 16:24.600
You're too young to say that!

16:24.940 --> 16:27.480
So shall we have a party?

16:27.630 --> 16:29.140
Anytime.

16:30.130 --> 16:31.820
Dress-up
Battle
In Session

16:31.860 --> 16:36.670
Back to the basics! This is in respect of the United Kingdom where the maid's costume originated!

16:37.340 --> 16:42.460
Non, non. The Industrial Revolution brought reform even to the maid's costume!

16:43.030 --> 16:45.740
My style is to conceal Yui's legs right to the very limit.

16:45.820 --> 16:48.200
Her Absolute Territory is only 3 millimeters in length.

16:48.710 --> 16:52.070
Pants? No! Drawers!

16:52.970 --> 16:55.500
China's 4000 year history created a fantastic dress!

16:56.440 --> 16:58.480
Simple is best!

16:59.530 --> 17:01.230
The queen of costumes!

17:01.230 --> 17:02.530
It feels so good...

17:02.690 --> 17:04.240
Tokikake rulez!

17:04.740 --> 17:06.830
Sweet temptation of the little devil.

17:07.200 --> 17:11.030
When it comes to temptation, I'll choose the angel in white, more like, the goddess in white!

17:11.210 --> 17:13.380
Boyish but seductive!

17:13.450 --> 17:16.330
Every boy can't help staring at the section under her arms!

17:16.540 --> 17:17.290
From the past...

17:17.320 --> 17:19.660
...to the future!

17:20.000 --> 17:21.970
Everybody has good childhood memories...

17:22.270 --> 17:23.640
Mom!

17:23.640 --> 17:24.580
Welcome home.

17:26.810 --> 17:29.660
Please don't make me do anymore.

17:31.140 --> 17:32.840
You did a good job, Takaya-kun.

17:34.290 --> 17:35.940
And so did you.

17:38.580 --> 17:40.960
Hey, where have you been, Mom?

17:40.960 --> 17:42.420
I'm sorry, Ayumi.

17:42.420 --> 17:44.950
I haven't had a happier day than this in a while.

17:44.950 --> 17:47.730
Yeah, you looked really nice in those costumes!

17:47.730 --> 17:49.050
Thank you.

17:49.050 --> 17:52.930
And you've already grown up to become a girl who looks good in cute dresses.

17:53.920 --> 17:56.480
You met your Mom at last. Good for you!

17:56.480 --> 17:57.550
Yup yup.

17:57.550 --> 18:01.330
Why does no one have doubts about what you've just done here?

18:02.160 --> 18:04.320
Thank you for taking care of my daughter.

18:04.330 --> 18:06.950
My name is Hagiwara Kanae.

18:06.950 --> 18:08.440
And I'm a widow.

18:08.710 --> 18:13.840
I don't think it's a good idea to emphasize being a widow in an introduction.

18:13.840 --> 18:18.720
While I was passing the café, I saw an interesting party inside, so I joined in without thinking.

18:19.010 --> 18:23.740
As a mother of one, you shouldn't take part in suspicious parties like these!

18:23.740 --> 18:26.470
Also, there are so many weird people here.

18:26.860 --> 18:30.330
Well, usually the only people who come to our café are Minori's fans.

18:30.330 --> 18:32.620
However, thanks to Yui-chan, we have a great deal of customers today.

18:33.990 --> 18:37.550
Can you handle this many customers?

18:37.930 --> 18:39.710
It can't be helped.

18:40.820 --> 18:43.170
Why don't we help them?

18:44.690 --> 18:45.650
Sure!

18:48.560 --> 18:52.000
The Dress-up
Party
Is Over

18:49.570 --> 18:51.410
Thank you very much!

18:52.150 --> 18:54.370
You two have been a great help.

18:54.370 --> 18:55.930
Thank you very much.

18:55.930 --> 18:57.190
My pleasure.

18:57.380 --> 19:00.830
Would you mind if I asked you to help us again once in a while?

19:01.520 --> 19:04.210
No, we're okay with it.

19:04.350 --> 19:06.770
Really? Oh, thank you!

19:07.300 --> 19:09.450
<i>Murase-san helped others.</i>

19:09.450 --> 19:11.890
<i>That means, he's not a mere good-for-nothing.</i>

19:13.210 --> 19:16.150
Then, we can work together from now on, right?

19:16.150 --> 19:17.730
I'm so happy, Takaya-san!

19:18.370 --> 19:21.070
If you work here, I will too!

19:22.000 --> 19:24.530
I wonder if I should work here as a waitress too.

19:25.260 --> 19:27.110
<i>They're so lovey-dovey...</i>

19:29.590 --> 19:32.010
What am I getting miffed for?

19:32.450 --> 19:35.020
There's no reason to...

19:35.050 --> 19:37.480
Oh darn! Hmph!

19:41.270 --> 19:42.710
Wow, so small!

19:42.820 --> 19:45.150
Yeah. He's really cute, isn't he?

19:45.360 --> 19:48.190
Can you let me hold him?

19:48.190 --> 19:49.430
Sure, go ahead.

19:54.130 --> 19:56.110
Ah, nice....

19:56.140 --> 19:59.830
I'm surrounded by Murase-san's collection of inanimate objects everyday.

19:59.830 --> 20:03.910
So, the feeling of touching a living creature is just irresistible!

20:04.580 --> 20:06.610
That comment sounds too abnormal!

20:06.970 --> 20:09.520
By the way, why do you have this baby?

20:09.520 --> 20:14.490
My relatives are moving, so I'm taking care of their baby today.

20:14.490 --> 20:18.950
Thought so. There's no way he's your baby.

20:18.950 --> 20:21.220
I hope there's no hidden meaning in that reaction.

20:22.450 --> 20:25.560
Actually, I wish that he really were my child.

20:26.830 --> 20:30.130
I'd like to go walking and shopping together with him.

20:30.340 --> 20:32.320
A N D...

20:32.710 --> 20:35.320
With my husband, Takaya-san...

20:37.450 --> 20:40.600
Then, why don't you try to have a baby with him, Sumitomo-san?

20:41.110 --> 20:42.870
Come on, Yui-chan!

20:43.220 --> 20:45.290
By the way, where's Takaya-san now?!

20:45.810 --> 20:49.160
Ah, Murase-san is out now.

20:49.850 --> 20:53.620
But I didn't know you wanted a baby that much.

20:54.140 --> 20:57.410
I was just talking about the possibility.

20:57.750 --> 21:01.090
But I'm hoping I will have a baby someday.

21:01.740 --> 21:04.080
'Cause I was born as a woman.

21:06.020 --> 21:08.250
<i>You should find a better partner first...</i>

21:11.430 --> 21:12.710
Yes, hello?

21:13.410 --> 21:14.410
Dad?

21:14.770 --> 21:17.390
Eh! I can't right now.

21:19.570 --> 21:22.010
Oh, what should I do?

21:22.010 --> 21:23.310
What's wrong?

21:23.640 --> 21:27.220
He told me to come to the café immediately...

21:27.220 --> 21:29.220
...'cause a large group of customers just came in.

21:29.610 --> 21:33.170
I have no idea what to do! I can't leave the baby alone.

21:33.900 --> 21:37.490
Well, I can look after him for you if you'd like.

21:37.820 --> 21:39.640
Eh, is it okay with you?

21:40.090 --> 21:42.420
Sure, if it won't take too long.

21:42.960 --> 21:45.370
Thank you! It's a great help!

21:46.730 --> 21:48.540
I'll be back soon.

21:49.640 --> 21:52.100
My breasts don't produce milk.

21:57.740 --> 22:02.080
<i>I took on a job requiring great responsibility while Murase-san is out.</i>

22:02.690 --> 22:06.890
<i>Well, it's not that hard since he's sound asleep.</i>

22:15.030 --> 22:18.810
<i>I guess I should continue doing laundry.</i>

22:19.260 --> 22:22.270
<i>I'm gonna go for a bit, so please sleep soundly.</i>

22:26.750 --> 22:29.950
What does this screaming mean?!

22:30.290 --> 22:32.230
Anyway, I've gotta do something about this.

22:32.230 --> 22:34.300
I'm sure there's something useful in Sumitomo-san's bag.

22:38.460 --> 22:39.950
Oh dear, what should I do?

22:41.530 --> 22:44.040
Do you want food, or to poo?

22:48.430 --> 22:49.900
<i>What should I do?</i>

22:49.900 --> 22:51.840
<i>Maybe I should call Sumitomo-san?</i>

22:51.840 --> 22:53.030
<i>No, I can't...</i>

22:55.140 --> 22:56.140
Murase-san!

22:56.520 --> 22:59.110
Yui, are you doing all right alone?

22:59.640 --> 23:01.440
Ah, how about you?

23:01.440 --> 23:05.150
I forgot how much fun shopping was.

23:05.970 --> 23:08.490
So, I guess I'll be back later than planned.

23:08.490 --> 23:09.900
I see...

23:10.730 --> 23:12.560
Isn't it rather noisy over there?

23:12.690 --> 23:15.240
Eh! It's the TV.

23:16.280 --> 23:17.270
I see.

23:17.270 --> 23:21.500
<i>There's no problem here at all, so take your time over there.</i>

23:24.920 --> 23:26.030
What have I done?!

23:26.030 --> 23:28.030
I couldn't tell him.

23:34.040 --> 23:35.140
Oh yeah!

23:35.140 --> 23:38.920
In this case, I should try the Maid's function made by Maid Works!

23:39.380 --> 23:41.580
Let's download!

23:45.070 --> 23:47.270
Michael, lock on to the target.

23:47.300 --> 23:49.290
Okay, bro. Fire!

23:53.090 --> 23:57.600
Now I've got perfect knowledge about babysitting.

23:58.150 --> 24:02.370
Now! Now! Now!

24:04.910 --> 24:06.060
Oh, so small.

24:06.950 --> 24:08.920
<i>Error detected.</i>

24:09.890 --> 24:14.920
Oh no! I never imagined that my maid functions could be damaged by pee.

24:15.380 --> 24:18.380
Didn't they have me waterproofed?

24:18.980 --> 24:19.820
Ah!

24:19.840 --> 24:20.820
My bad.

24:23.280 --> 24:24.500
What should I do?

24:24.970 --> 24:27.880
Who needs a maid that can't even take care of one baby?

24:28.170 --> 24:31.060
Nobody needs one!

24:31.250 --> 24:33.380
Geez, what a useless maid!

24:34.390 --> 24:35.910
Crappy robot!

24:34.390 --> 24:35.910
Please wait!

24:35.960 --> 24:39.850
Don't throw me away, Murase-san!

24:35.960 --> 24:39.850
Do you want me to break you up into parts for my computer?

24:41.690 --> 24:45.370
Oh yeah, I think there may be something useful in the closet.

24:45.860 --> 24:46.940
Here!

24:48.100 --> 24:51.860
<i>I know he has everything, but he even has these?</i>

24:52.330 --> 24:55.760
<i>Murase-san! At times like these, I sincerely respect you.</i>

24:56.470 --> 24:59.020
But this seems to be for adults.

25:00.960 --> 25:04.120
Ah, yes, yes. Give me a moment.

25:08.000 --> 25:09.740
How's this?

25:14.410 --> 25:16.740
I did it, Murase-san!

25:18.840 --> 25:22.070
<i>So this would be what makes mothers feel happy.</i>

25:26.970 --> 25:29.910
Ah, my breasts don't produce milk.

25:29.910 --> 25:30.870
Stop it, please!

25:31.340 --> 25:33.360
Hey, here's your milk.

25:34.180 --> 25:36.980
Hey, stop...

25:43.360 --> 25:45.510
Maybe I should head back early.

25:45.800 --> 25:48.400
It was rather noisy over there when I called.

25:48.400 --> 25:51.900
<i>Babies... Babies are...</i>

25:52.410 --> 25:54.880
<i>Babies are so cute!</i>

25:55.460 --> 26:00.330
I'm gonna look after you like I'm your Mom until Sumitomo-san comes back.

26:04.280 --> 26:06.400
Don't tell me, that is...

26:07.870 --> 26:10.500
Oh no! Hey, just a moment.

26:10.500 --> 26:13.410
I'm trying to prepare myself for it.

26:16.410 --> 26:19.000
Please behave yourself.

26:19.000 --> 26:21.630
I'm almost done here.

26:22.410 --> 26:24.560
Here! Thank you for waiting!

26:31.240 --> 26:32.960
That was really close.

26:33.480 --> 26:36.190
I can't take my eyes off you.

26:37.770 --> 26:40.600
Man, you're just like him.

26:41.240 --> 26:42.830
Yours is also like his?

26:48.040 --> 26:49.660
<i>What the heck is that?!</i>

27:04.980 --> 27:06.840
So cute!

27:06.870 --> 27:09.310
A small elephant!

27:28.830 --> 27:32.510
<i>Yui loves babies.</i>

27:36.310 --> 27:37.650
I'm back.

27:38.300 --> 27:39.620
Yui?

27:39.620 --> 27:42.950
Oh, you can't put that into your mouth.

27:44.230 --> 27:45.700
Don't, okay?

27:47.160 --> 27:48.440
<i>A baby!?</i>

27:48.520 --> 27:50.520
<i>Oh my, since when...</i>

27:50.780 --> 27:53.310
<i>Since when did that option become available?</i>

27:54.430 --> 27:55.960
Don't do that either.

27:55.960 --> 27:58.370
Murase-san may scold you.

27:58.370 --> 28:00.450
Okay? Good boy...

28:02.520 --> 28:05.470
Oh? Welcome home, Murase-san.

28:05.650 --> 28:07.240
Yeah, I'm back.

28:09.820 --> 28:12.360
W-w-w-what the hell is that?!

28:12.360 --> 28:14.360
Don't call him "that."

28:14.360 --> 28:16.210
I was asked to take care of the baby.

28:16.210 --> 28:18.200
I'm talking about the other thing!

28:18.440 --> 28:21.460
I'm sorry for being late...

28:21.760 --> 28:23.130
What are you wearing?!

28:23.130 --> 28:26.160
Huh? Don't you know?

28:26.160 --> 28:28.170
This is what babysitters have to wear.
